# Wikipedia dump cache — fetched and checksum-verified by scripts/corpus-fetch.mjs.
# Not vendored: 2.4 MB, and reproducible from the pinned URL + sha256.
.corpus/

# Brand asset masters — the full kit: vector masters, every icon size, the
# lockups, the wordmarks. Only the handful the site actually serves is vendored,
# in public/ (favicon, the four icon sizes a browser or an installed app asks
# for, and the OG image). See "Brand" in README.md.
#
# NOTE: ignoring this means the masters live nowhere in version control. A clone
# can serve the site but cannot regenerate an icon at a new size. Keep the kit
# backed up somewhere that is not this working copy.
exports/
